  "title": "Demand for Contactless Shopping Is Higher Than Ever",
  "summary": "Demand for contactless shopping continues to rise as consumers shift away from cash and toward digital payments. With fewer shoppers preferring cash and more planning to use digital wallets, expectations for seamless, touch-free experiences are becoming the norm. VenHub meets this shift by enabling safe, efficient shopping through a fully autonomous, contactless retail experience.",
